```console
$ scherzo-cloud publication --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud publications

Usage: scherzo-cloud publication [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create a Scherzo Cloud publication
  list    List Scherzo Cloud publications
  show    Show a Scherzo Cloud publication
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
